Design brief (seed 2): Design a spatial-offset prefetcher that issues prefetches more than one cache line ahead, keeps a per-region confidence counter, and suppresses issue when confidence is low.

Return only one ```cpp fenced block holding the complete module, including the three #include lines. No prose, no comments describing the plan.

